      "content": "gotcha. so it's mostly about trust and regulation. i guess i'm just nervous because it feels weird having such a large amount of money just sitting in a \"neutral\" space where neither the buyer nor the seller can touch it until the very end. it feels a bit like it's being hoarded or something. is that a common way to think about it?",
